@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/external_operations/{operation_uuid}/actions/retry/invoke
actor "客户端" as C
participant "REST / RestAlchemy\n控制器" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n定律行/阅读行" as DB
queue "Immutable outbox event\n+ delivery_snapshot_event 1:1" as O
participant "工作者/管理者\n提供商处理器" as W
database "准备的存储器\n公共活动" as E
participant "控制器\nWebSocket" as D
actor "连接的客户端" as WC

C -> API: 查询 POST + bearer-标志物 IAM
activate API
API -> DB: 封锁/检查规范区域
API -> DB: 记录状态变化
API -> O: event -> delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
DB --> API: 已被记录的状态
O --> API: 已固定的记录
API --> C: 卫生照 200
deactivate API
W -> O: claim exact scope; lease/fencing/retry/DLQ
group 一个 DB transaction
  W -> DB: 能够更新投影或控制
  W -> E: durable ready external_operation.updated
end
note right of W
  如果工作涉及到安置 Messenger:
  一个插槽独占所有 (project_id, topic_uuid)
  并且处理 MESSAGE.created_at DESC.
  提供商的管理工作保持了自己的稳定秩序.
end note
D -> E: 播放下一个可见时代
E --> D: 事件的平面图片
D --> WC: 事件 WebSocket / 重复

note over API,DB
  公开链接 UUID 是一个直角 UUID-属性.
  物理列 *_uuid 仍然是索引 FK.
end note
@enduml
